{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "book",
  "title": "书本",
  "description": "用于展示 3D 书本封面并在悬停时播放动画的展示组件。",
  "category": "misc",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "x-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "应用于组件的额外类。"
    },
    {
      "name": "duration",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "动画持续时间（毫秒）。",
      "default": "1000"
    },
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "BookColor",
      "required": false,
      "description": "书本渐变的配色主题。",
      "default": "\"zinc\""
    },
    {
      "name": "isStatic",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "为 true 时禁用悬停动画。",
      "default": "false"
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "BookSize",
      "required": false,
      "description": "书本尺寸变体。",
      "default": "\"md\""
    },
    {
      "name": "radius",
      "type": "BookRadius",
      "required": false,
      "description": "书本圆角变体。",
      "default": "\"md\""
    },
    {
      "name": "shadowSize",
      "type": "BookShadowSize",
      "required": false,
      "description": "阴影大小变体。",
      "default": "\"lg\""
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "default",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<template>\n  <div class=\"grid place-content-center p-10\">\n    <Book>\n      <BookHeader>\n        <Icon\n          name=\"heroicons:book-open-solid\"\n          size=\"24\"\n        />\n      </BookHeader>\n      <BookTitle>\n        <h1>The Book</h1>\n      </BookTitle>\n      <BookDescription>\n        <p>Hover me to animate!</p>\n      </BookDescription>\n    </Book>\n  </div>\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "文档、电子书、课程等资源的封面入口展示。",
    "需要按 zinc 等配色主题与 size / radius / shadowSize 变体快速定制的书本视觉。",
    "落地页中需要悬停动画点缀的内容卡片。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "常规内容卡片，改用 reborn-card。",
    "需要正反两面内容切换的卡片，改用 flip-card。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "封面内容需用配套子组件组织：BookHeader、BookTitle、BookDescription。",
    "isStatic 为 true 时禁用悬停动画；duration 单位为毫秒（默认 1000）。"
  ],
